WEBVTT

00:12:29.716 --> 00:12:30.916
On People,

00:12:30.956 --> 00:12:34.236
I'm going to commit to be more present
with the people I care about.

00:12:34.796 --> 00:12:37.276
For the last four years,
I've essentially been single

00:12:37.316 --> 00:12:40.076
and if I'm really honest,
I was emotionally unavailable.

00:12:40.796 --> 00:12:43.716
But I've actually been very fortunate
to meet someone amazing.

00:12:43.716 --> 00:12:46.876
So what I’m going to do is
commit to investing in that relationship

00:12:46.876 --> 00:12:50.916
with openness, authenticity
and vulnerability.

00:12:51.396 --> 00:12:53.436
And a little bit of cheekiness.

00:12:54.676 --> 00:12:56.196
And on Purpose,

00:12:56.236 --> 00:12:58.996
a year ago, I was actually
a one on Purpose.

00:12:59.756 --> 00:13:01.396
My purpose was twofold,